here are no suitable pairs of \\(d\\) and \\(e\\) that fit these criteria, which is disappointing!"}]},{"id":"rs_0d852574a0adead3016af2595fb44487d086f0dd0eee19484e","type":"reasoning","content":[],"encrypted_content":"gAAAAABq8llwgiKGQd9psJvx-iSDLdW0E_ufOCCvJz6bCxfz3xBRZP61K2nswU5eQaaHrTF-A-p4NPme6TG3G-ZCvGhQo763vnoShurgXgHGLPeg2sMMNfCot1SDe7TM0w3ciaY20DAi8mWyalbCSFGXqgjS1wnQK3mWPgtHpqZwaESZIjctUdl3co97FKMYt61ta_37LHAY_lhc86MLNg8ZwX0RlboGXiNnKTYzwJMQbqKhIWJBWo58H7v_tlUE_M19EmgRb4ggczSDV6Bup0-d7qL9bBnso8ayybuWqcbNy2z_EB0YMygGObOx0kKgDFSN9qNPZtqSo05kScVya49ImdXMi3M1mxApWp9tXMhSHa6ECDcXiksYz0r6fKR0jvYj5UWrrsFgYM2h4bO3gRzSZp1vkMjrmgE9gwz2n008eTq9s_vtT83CRI9IwzQ00qACDncJUkUBFb_BJJaBxkEhgzcWb4ycZIFJBPqVOvmcviDd9ur4J-m535phtOpIWGclea0Q03l4ZYAEnFe_GWDahayt5-l1nKeFkTEKa7IvEREL-gLUoeVKaNKX62fs1mSvXY-TC84voqX___0kXlAgTGWtSxKj8PwT8f-gyYI195ktpVFkcSP-cvompPXudDsvEBONqiHNBYm_NUYF39yhpOUMGIpefrIO1so90VO-6YU9ITq1uwBUgbY8X9AjxqrkCpCBeY8QwimD1eICQx9zq63OI-H86C1Yr72l-3dHWd1PLAHQIkpIfbU6UyszJEzZ7bxcTmDiy4vk41knw9SFwWGF8mC0DHQadNRdrAhBGBla9NTCHLBjbYZLIA9MkwDTBqtb2Sc5JRvIsbVVpprQHFHZCPcALHIVs75VDyJo1gCIQk1O4ZRXAbBm9G-2UeGFPhX5U9hnKO13Xu9L_IaXHXJoCzWrFszDbXW1wj10Kma5e7dgRyHaaCHFbVfkBctBFRpHQl_6JSvyWqZkxrKChJkBlg-vY_K1YjKqvxF2KQHGpE5HIzjJhJ876YT2V1FrLhMl-aFPKOapNh5l_fKsF360joslaNCC0IoHw_3VwBNdXu065BV-FfjXcZVNNCaLn99nvGo0U_FV7MNpsZEOKkc0qiIKUKdxlDcbRxp6-nfO0zQT1ECcUgVt0C_ohzyzAVMjpgUP9JxYs32GQyfjASxaccx9h2l0OUNFQCfykjX2PjrbQeEP3fzRjOJZlXG4-bY1doEQRCUfkxoXf0X9futosefsG3ejW8fRu8gCIVJgOduo26nfz0A14sc2RnmgG1iMVpKcShgnfPcyEJyEjwvyOIvcSRGgCQ0ataTMMlqtnyDC3An-ItXhGdg5q-pMCAGdIrF35WsKhljT1idhQmzjDga2MEUjfNAjIoU4cCJ0p0DvlEUYO9mHrB4kQy2OSzoZSRIzbQ4ZibdW8R_dKLh4UCW5nATr0GAXIv7FQNs3GgXilxxCjJkhtSYoY5YcEZffWTQFkGPCF2WcdOMlJdrV_PXRkRpS8yCJnfFdDWaBV8-j740dhU0YbusW630AcAyBUbnaRfRJ2TZ9FSIKfVZCSsXao8mLIpWCxHAWv2bpbvazjIvJt6wk7MjhYF3L6cunH_CQtNZpTFNJrETJOQH3FTlvLyEhWhWCkIVSSSWnSrMlsSM2ALpl26AMMnsrVatxefOJaPZ8Rl8dK4fqt1RKyXrmCiBL1r3S9QRuJVaGnjSmtAladyA0_268iduuGDkgG7VdkOClHcGyrmwlyT3CrLB35eoi6zwyyAgiaXb2L7EnhG